ig_syntax:
```ig
// Aliases for alternative confirmations
participant_confirms := participant_confirms_by_speech | participant_confirms_by_nod

// Main greeting sequence
robot_greets → robot_asks_confirmation @within(1s) site(greeting)

// Conditional confirmation sequences
participant chooses to confirm by saying yes during robot_asks_confirmation → participant_confirms_by_speech @within(2s) site(confirmation)
participant chooses to confirm by nodding during robot_asks_confirmation → participant_confirms_by_nod @within(2s) site(confirmation)

// Repair for no response
repair(site=confirmation, max_retries=2) participant_does_not_respond → robot_repeats_request
failure(site=confirmation) if repair_exhausted

// Interruption handling sequence
participant_interrupts → robot_stops_speaking @within(1s) site(interaction)
robot_stops_speaking → robot_acknowledges_interruption @within(2s) site(interaction)
robot_acknowledges_interruption → robot_continues @within(1s) site(interaction)
```
